9-04-26","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Christian Hanke","x":"Looking at our market development for the rest of the year on the next slide, the outlook for major light vehicle markets has become increasingly more uncertain due to weaker consumer confidence, trade tariffs and regulatory changes.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/04/26/autoliv-inc-alv-q1-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"ALV 2019 Q1","e":"alv","d":"2019-04-26","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Mikael Bratt","x":"Geopolitical uncertainty has been increasing, volatile raw material prices, trade tariffs, Brexit, new emission regulations as well as more local issues such as increasing difficulties to pass the border between Mexico and the U.S. These developments lead to increased uncertainty.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/04/26/autoliv-inc-alv-q1-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"ALV 2019 Q1","e":"alv","d":"2019-04-26","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Mikael Bratt","x":"We aim to address volume and cost challenges with cost reduction activities including hiring freeze, reduction of temporary personnel and under cost measures.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/04/26/autoliv-inc-alv-q1-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"ALV 2019 Q1","e":"alv","d":"2019-04-26","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Mikael Bratt","x":"In parallel, we are streamlining product design and engineering to speed up new launches and improve engineering efficiency.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/04/26/autoliv-inc-alv-q1-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"ALV 2019 Q2","e":"alv","d":"2019-07-19","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Christian Hanke","x":"The outlook for major light vehicle markets has become increasingly more uncertain due to weaker consumer confidence, trade tariffs and regulatory changes.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/07/19/autoliv-inc-alv-q2-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"ALV 2019 Q2","e":"alv","d":"2019-07-19","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Mikael Bratt","x":"We are closely managing tariffs in place today, such as 232 and 301 [Phonetic] while monitoring potential new tariffs by implementing number of actions we expect to be able to mitigate the vast majority of the potential $30 million cost that the new tariff otherwise would amount to in North…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/07/19/autoliv-inc-alv-q2-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"ALV 2019 Q2","e":"alv","d":"2019-07-19","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Mikael Bratt","x":"I am generally pleased with how we manage the sharp decline in global LVP by the cost reduction actions well implemented and we are planning for.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/07/19/autoliv-inc-alv-q2-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"ALV 2019 Q2","e":"alv","d":"2019-07-19","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Mikael Bratt","x":"Streamline product design and engineering to speed up new launches and improve engineering efficiency, review our footprint to meet future demand.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/07/19/autoliv-inc-alv-q2-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"ALV 2019 Q3","e":"alv","d":"2019-10-25","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Christian Hanke","x":"The outlook for major light vehicle markets has become increasingly more uncertain due to weaker consumer confidence, trade tariffs and regulatory changes.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/25/autoliv-inc-alv-q3-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"ALV 2019 Q3","e":"alv","d":"2019-10-25","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Steven Hempel","x":"Okay, and then just looking at Slide 3 here in terms of the cost reduction, you're breaking it out by business cycle management versus structural efficiency and within those two buckets there is indirect headcount being taken out by both.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/25/autoliv-inc-alv-q3-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"ALV 2019 Q3","e":"alv","d":"2019-10-25","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Sascha Gommel","x":"So, how much of the step -- or of the restructuring costs are already cashed in, in the quarter.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/25/autoliv-inc-alv-q3-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"ALV 2019 Q4","e":"alv","d":"2020-01-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Mikael Bratt","x":"Most operations will be impacted, and we expect a headcount reduction of around 800.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/01/30/autoliv-inc-alv-q4-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"ALV 2020 Q1","e":"alv","d":"2020-04-24","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Mikael Bratt","x":"The task force we set up to initially manage the situation in China has been expanded to global scale, and have been able to act promptly with timely cost reduction actions to offset much of the headwinds from the weaker light vehicle production in the quarter.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/04/24/autoliv-inc-alv-q1-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"ALV 2020 Q1","e":"alv","d":"2020-04-24","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Mikael Bratt","x":"We have also reduced or suspended investments and spending that are not critical for daily operations, accelerated cost savings initiatives, furloughed personnel, often in government sponsored programs, and reduced compensation for executive officers and Board members.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/04/24/autoliv-inc-alv-q1-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"ALV 2020 Q1","e":"alv","d":"2020-04-24","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Mikael Bratt","x":"Given the uncertainty in the market, we have withdrawn our full year guidance, until the effects of COVID-19 pandemic can be better assessed.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/04/24/autoliv-inc-alv-q1-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"ALV 2020 Q1","e":"alv","d":"2020-04-24","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Mikael Bratt","x":"Consequently, we withdrew our full year guidance, and it is not possible to determine when a new full-year outlook can be made.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/04/24/autoliv-inc-alv-q1-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"ALV 2020 Q2","e":"alv","d":"2020-07-17","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Mikael Bratt","x":"We have undertaken a number of actions to manage the evolving situation by accelerating cost savings, reducing expenses and strengthening our liquidity position.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/07/17/autoliv-inc-alv-q2-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"ALV 2020 Q2","e":"alv","d":"2020-07-17","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Mikael Bratt","x":"However, it is essential to balance the cost reduction response against the need for capacity to manage the recovery that has started.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/07/17/autoliv-inc-alv-q2-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"ALV 2020 Q3","e":"alv","d":"2020-10-23","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Mikael Bratt","x":"To manage the evolving situation, we have accelerated cost savings, reduced expenses and strengthened our balance sheet.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/10/23/autoliv-inc-alv-q3-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ALV 2020 Q3","e":"alv","d":"2020-10-23","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Mikael Bratt","x":"Adjusted operating income including cost for capacity alignment, antitrust related matters and in 2019 separation of our business segments, increased by 13% to $206 million, mainly as a result of our forceful cost reduction activities.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/10/23/autoliv-inc-alv-q3-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ALV 2020 Q4","e":"alv","d":"2021-01-26","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Mikael Bratt","x":"Despite the challenging year for automotive suppliers, we managed to achieve a year-on-year cost reduction of more than 4% for components, material and logistics, including 90 basis points from raw material price changes.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/01/26/autoliv-inc-alv-q4-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ALV 2020 Q4","e":"alv","d":"2021-01-26","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Joseph Spak","x":"But now, since you've taken a lot of cost action to right size for that volume and the [Indecipherable] were little bit stronger.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/01/26/autoliv-inc-alv-q4-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ALV 2021 Q1","e":"alv","d":"2021-04-23","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Chris McNally","x":"You talked a little bit about, it takes some time six to 12 months for the Tier 2s to pass it through things like steel and belt and fasteners.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/23/autoliv-inc-alv-q1-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ALV 2021 Q1","e":"alv","d":"2021-04-23","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Chris McNally","x":"Would it make sense to think about even if raw material stayed where they are flat right now, we probably have some raw material pressure into next year just given the annualization and maybe it takes them one or two price increases to send it through.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/23/autoliv-inc-alv-q1-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ALV 2021 Q1","e":"alv","d":"2021-04-23","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Mikael Bratt","x":"Despite these negative effects, we reiterate our full year guidance as these effects are offset by an improved sales mix and improved cost structure as evidenced by the first quarter performance.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/23/autoliv-inc-alv-q1-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ALV 2021 Q1","e":"alv","d":"2021-04-23","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Mikael Bratt","x":"So that all combined then it makes it possible for us to offset the higher impact we see from raw materials and that's how we then can confirm the guidance also on the 10% margin side.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/23/autoliv-inc-alv-q1-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ALV 2021 Q2","e":"alv","d":"2021-07-19","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Chris McNally","x":"Maybe just real quick, just high-level, do you exert that same pressure then, like another opportunity to go to your [Indecipherable] base and basically ask for delays and in price increases when obviously you're not buying raw steel, but obviously manufactured parts.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/07/19/autoliv-inc-alv-q2-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ALV 2021 Q2","e":"alv","d":"2021-07-19","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Joseph Spak","x":"You mentioned typically 25% to 30% pass-through, 30% when it's volatile like it was this quarter on the way down.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/07/19/autoliv-inc-alv-q2-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ALV 2021 Q2","e":"alv","d":"2021-07-19","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Fredrik Westin","x":"We believe the actions undertaken in the quarter, such as reducing headcount by more than 2,000 contributed to limiting the detrimental margin.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/07/19/autoliv-inc-alv-q2-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ALV 2021 Q2","e":"alv","d":"2021-07-19","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Fredrik Westin","x":"We also had the restructuring outflow of around $6 million.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/07/19/autoliv-inc-alv-q2-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ALV 2021 Q3","e":"alv","d":"2021-10-22","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Fredrik Westin","x":"We have some limited contractual pass-through to customers.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/10/22/autoliv-inc-alv-q3-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ALV 2021 Q3","e":"alv","d":"2021-10-22","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Mikael Bratt","x":"I think it of course depends on how the situation in mainly China then develops, but we all know that the reason why we have price increases in magnesium is that they have reduced production in China as a result of power shortage there in the near-term.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/10/22/autoliv-inc-alv-q3-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ALV 2021 Q3","e":"alv","d":"2021-10-22","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Mikael Bratt","x":"The decline in LVP, unpredictable changes in customer call-offs, and high raw material costs resulted in reduced profitability in the quarter despite strict cost control, including a significant headcount reduction.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/10/22/autoliv-inc-alv-q3-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ALV 2021 Q3","e":"alv","d":"2021-10-22","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Fredrik Westin","x":"In total, we have reduced headcount by over 4,500 since the end of the first quarter, of which 2,500 in the third quarter.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/10/22/autoliv-inc-alv-q3-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ALV 2025 Q3","e":"alv","d":"2025-10-17","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Fredrik Westin","x":"This was partly offset by negative effects from recalls and warranty, depreciation, and unrecovered tariff costs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/10/17/autoliv-alv-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ALV 2025 Q3","e":"alv","d":"2025-10-17","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Fredrik Westin","x":"The combination of unrecovered tariffs and the dilutive effect of the recovered portion resulted in a negative impact of approximately 20 basis points on our operating margin in the quarter.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/10/17/autoliv-alv-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ALV 2025 Q3","e":"alv","d":"2025-10-17","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Fredrik Westin","x":"It's still, if we take 2024 as the base point with 9.7% adjusted operating margin, we still expect 80 basis points improvement from the indirect headcount reduction.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/10/17/autoliv-alv-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ALV 2025 Q3","e":"alv","d":"2025-10-17","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Fredrik Westin","x":"If you adjust for that, we would also have shown further progress on the indirect headcount reduction.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/10/17/autoliv-alv-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ALV 2025 Q4","e":"alv","d":"2026-01-30","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Mikael Bratt","x":"We recovered close to 100% of tariff costs in the fourth quarter.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/01/30/autoliv-alv-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ALV 2025 Q4","e":"alv","d":"2026-01-30","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Mikael Bratt","x":"Fourth quarter sales increased by 8% year-over-year, driven by strong outperformance relative to LVP, along with favorable currency effects and tariff-related compensations.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/01/30/autoliv-alv-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ALV 2025 Q4","e":"alv","d":"2026-01-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Mikael Bratt","x":"These achievements reflect the performance of the whole Autoliv team and the depth of our customer partnerships and our dedication to ongoing structural cost savings.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/01/30/autoliv-alv-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ALV 2025 Q4","e":"alv","d":"2026-01-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Fredrik Westin","x":"And then lastly, the structural cost savings, so we have now achieved about $100 million of the $130 million that we set out or detailed out when we announced the plan.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/01/30/autoliv-alv-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ALV 2026 Q1","e":"alv","d":"2026-04-17","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Monika Grama","x":"This was partly offset by increased tariff costs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/17/autoliv-alv-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ALV 2026 Q1","e":"alv","d":"2026-04-17","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Monika Grama","x":"During the quarter, we recovered approximately 70% of our U.S. tariff costs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/17/autoliv-alv-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ALV 2026 Q1","e":"alv","d":"2026-04-17","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Mikael Bratt","x":"So what we're saying here is that the gross exposure we have here should be mitigated either by price increases and internal, let's say, self-help through other activities here, but majority is price increases here.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/17/autoliv-alv-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ALV 2026 Q1","e":"alv","d":"2026-04-17","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Mikael Bratt","x":"From a mitigation standpoint, we continue to execute on productivity and cost reduction initiatives to offset these costs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/17/autoliv-alv-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ALV 2026 Q1","e":"alv","d":"2026-04-17","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Emmanuel Rosner","x":"Now we are tapping in again in structural cost savings and our known resilience in challenging times.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/17/autoliv-alv-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ALV 2026 Q3","e":"alv","d":"2026-10-23","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Monika Grama","x":"During the quarter, we achieved customer compensation covering more than 80% of tariff costs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/10/23/autoliv-alv-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ALV 2026 Q3","e":"alv","d":"2026-10-23","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Monika Grama","x":"However, tariff related headwinds still reduced our adjusted operating margin, by around 35 basis points, including dilutive effects.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/10/23/autoliv-alv-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ALV 2026 Q3","e":"alv","d":"2026-10-23","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Monika Grama","x":"This was partly offset by positive FX effects and supplier cost reduction.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/10/23/autoliv-alv-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ALV 2026 Q3","e":"alv","d":"2026-10-23","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Monika Grama","x":"Operational contributed $34 million despite slightly lower sales primarily driven by cost reduction activities.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/10/23/autoliv-alv-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"}],"trends":{"theater":[[35,1,7711,0,0,0,5926,1375],[37,1,8388,0,0,0,6493,1278],[38,1,8520,0,0,0,6626,1329],[39,1,8487,0,0,0,6723,1235],[40,1,8644,0,0,0,6748,1438],[41,1,8805,0,0,0,6369,1873],[42,1,8727,0,0,0,6576,1717],[43,1,7828,0,0,0,5587,1769],[44,1,9008,0,0,0,6596,1840],[45,1,7550,0,0,0,5024,2035],[46,1,8856,0,0,0,6213,2176],[47,1,6826,0,0,0,5060,1421],[63,1,7706,0,0,0,3151,3621],[64,1,7659,0,0,0,6341,1066],[65,1,7279,0,0,0,1230,5683],[67,1,8351,0,0,0,1506,6334]],"cinema":[[35,1,7711,0,0,0,5926,1375],[37,1,8388,0,0,0,6493,1278],[38,1,8520,0,0,0,6626,1329],[39,1,8487,0,0,0,6723,1235],[40,1,8644,0,0,0,6748,1438],[41,1,8805,0,0,0,6369,1873],[42,1,8727,0,0,0,6576,1717],[43